    "detailed_description": "This game is an RPG maker game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is a basic RPG maker game with turn-based combat.<br />\r\nThere is a pattern for each fighter; you have to play to your opponent's behavior, not just fight.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has a main story and a sub-story. As you progress through the sub-stories, you'll learn about the fighters' stories.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you find the game too difficult, look around - there are sure to be NPCs giving you hints!<br />\r\nYou can also earn in-game money to improve your skills or increase your HP MAX, which will give you an advantage in battle!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhen you win or lose a battle, you get a contextual CG, which is basically in every battle, and subquests also have CGs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDoNyan first game SBcatfight<br />\r\nI did my best, but you might see some flaws.<br />\r\nI hope you enjoyed playing it!",
